Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.79,0:00:12.01,QuoteAttribution,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(950,0)\pos(574,180)}George Santayana
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.59,0:00:19.34,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,The one I believe should \Nbe expelled on this exam...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.55,0:00:23.29,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yamauchi Haruki-kun...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.53,0:00:25.77,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:25.77,0:00:26.47,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.63,0:00:29.47,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Why me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.47,0:00:34.48,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You've contributed little \Nto the class all year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.48,0:00:36.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Th-That's not true!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:36.61,0:00:39.49,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,And Ken and Kanji are just as bad as me!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.17,0:00:41.45,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,True.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.08,0:00:47.07,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But though you're on roughly the same \Nlevel, you're still a half-step behind.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:51.17,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You can't be serious!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.17,0:00:52.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Doesn't she make you guys mad?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.61,0:00:53.92,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Kanji? Ken?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.42,0:00:59.03,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,H-Hey...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:59.44,0:01:01.15,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Say something, you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.93,0:01:06.16,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,K-Koenji's a problem child who \Neven skips out on special exams!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.16,0:01:08.10,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I'm not nearly as bad as him!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.34,0:01:11.98,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It's true that Koenji-kun has \Na great deal to account for.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.49,0:01:16.18,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But in terms of sheer ability, \Nhe's far superior to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.09,0:01:19.11,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.11,0:01:20.33,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I just...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.66,0:01:26.33,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.33,0:01:30.87,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Then shall I explain my decisive \Nreason for choosing you?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:32.59,0:01:34.51,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Decisive reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.31,0:01:42.09,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,{\an8}You were rallying negative votes to \Nexpel Ayanokoji-kun, were you not?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.82,0:01:55.01,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,He was... trying to expel Ayanokoji-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.35,0:02:00.12,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yes, it's indisputably true.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.12,0:02:02.75,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Th-That wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.75,0:02:06.73,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Someone else told me to vote against him!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.03,0:02:08.39,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,And who was that?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.39,0:02:11.75,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,It... It was Kanji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.75,0:02:12.74,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.47,0:02:16.49,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Is this true, Ike-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.49,0:02:17.71,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,No, no way!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:17.71,0:02:18.83,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Um...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.83,0:02:23.92,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Kikyo-chan said someone was in \Ntrouble and needed our help...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.51,0:02:27.50,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Were you the ringleader, then, Kushida-san?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.70,0:02:31.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! Kikyo-chan came up to me!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.61,0:02:34.05,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,She told me to expel Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.05,0:02:35.28,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,M-Me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.28,0:02:37.89,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,It was the same for all you guys, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.89,0:02:39.21,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,How could you?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.63,0:02:41.51,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,You're awful, Yamauchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.51,0:02:44.81,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,You asked me to help you!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.17,0:02:47.52,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,And even though I didn't want to do it...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.52,0:02:50.15,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I worked hard to do it anyway!
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.48,0:02:52.55,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Kushida-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.16,0:02:56.03,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You are a student with a \Ngreat deal of influence here.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.94,0:03:00.53,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You surely knew what would \Nhappen if you helped him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.50,0:03:05.29,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I hope that, in the future, you'll expend \Nyour efforts in the service of the class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.31,0:03:11.24,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Still, it now seems indisputable that the \Norigin of the problem was Yamauchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.24,0:03:13.09,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,H-Hang on, Horikita.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.09,0:03:15.05,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,It wasn't me!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.84,0:03:17.55,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,My, my. Hasn't this gotten interesting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:17.87,0:03:24.81,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,But the mere act of targeting someone \Nseems within bounds this exam.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.33,0:03:30.31,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Is there a reason he's the only \None being chastised for it?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.31,0:03:31.97,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Wh-What he said!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.97,0:03:33.07,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yamauchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.83,0:03:36.47,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're meeting with Sakayanagi-san \Nbehind the scenes
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.47,0:03:38.95,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,and acting on her orders, aren't you?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.31,0:03:41.59,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Hey, Haruki, is she serious?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.59,0:03:43.25,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Sh-She's making it up!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.25,0:03:44.95,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,She doesn't have any proof!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.29,0:03:47.68,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Would you show us your phone, perhaps?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.34,0:03:51.46,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You surely have Sakayanagi-san's \Ncontact information saved there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.46,0:03:52.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Er...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.07,0:03:56.60,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,She's my friend. \NThere's nothing strange about that!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.60,0:03:59.45,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Hey... are you seriously \Nsharing info with Class A?!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.45,0:04:02.44,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Th-There's no way I'd betray the class!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.44,0:04:04.72,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,G-Give me a break already!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.31,0:04:09.48,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm sure she was offering compensation \Nto make it worth your while.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.81,0:04:13.74,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,For instance... an offer \Nof personal time together?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.89,0:04:16.11,Main,Onodera,0,0,0,,What, like dating him?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.11,0:04:17.76,Main,Shinohara,0,0,0,,Gross!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:18.09,0:04:23.62,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,We can't allow a superior student to be \Nexpelled for such a ridiculous reason.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.05,0:04:28.12,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,This is the primary reason I'm \Npushing for your expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.49,0:04:32.15,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Betraying your classmates to \Nmake a pact with the enemy
Dialogue: 0,0:04:32.15,0:04:35.63,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,and selling out one of your own comrades...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.99,0:04:40.73,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,These acts make you an unwelcome \Npresence in this classroom.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.73,0:04:42.21,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,B-But...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.21,0:04:44.08,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I have no objections.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.08,0:04:47.98,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,I'm throwing my lot in with my Horikita girl.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.98,0:04:51.03,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,W-Wait! I didn't betray you guys!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.03,0:04:52.45,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I've been busting my butt!
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.45,0:04:57.25,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Anyone who doesn't support my reasoning can \Nwrite my own name down in the negative.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.58,0:04:59.88,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I've expressed my opinion.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.24,0:05:03.49,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I hope you'll think on it \Nand make your own decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:04.05,0:05:05.79,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Hang on, Suzune!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.79,0:05:07.49,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,I see what you're getting at.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.49,0:05:09.96,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,But I can't go along with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.43,0:05:12.62,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,I can't expel a friend!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.89,0:05:15.90,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I understand that you value your friends.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:16.81,0:05:21.26,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,But protecting one person means \Nsacrificing someone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:22.27,0:05:24.51,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,That's why we need to approach this test
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.94,0:05:27.05,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,not emotionally, but logically.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:28.55,0:05:29.83,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Sorry, Haruki.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.29,0:05:32.46,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,There's nothing I can do here.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.63,0:05:35.36,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,The matter appears settled, then.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.36,0:05:36.04,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.04,0:05:37.55,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hang on, hang on!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:37.55,0:05:39.27,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,This is so stupid!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:39.27,0:05:44.00,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Object all you want, but there's no one \Nelse here more worthy of negative votes.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:44.00,0:05:45.99,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Say what you want!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.99,0:05:50.24,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,The others all promised to vote Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.24,0:05:53.18,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,You'd better keep your promise \Nto Kikyo-chan, okay?!
Dialogue: 0,0:05:53.54,0:05:55.37,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I... I take it back.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.37,0:05:55.91,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:55.91,0:05:57.59,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I was wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.99,0:06:02.42,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,I take back my request \Nfor all of you to help me!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:02.42,0:06:04.65,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hang on a minute, Kushida!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:04.65,0:06:06.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,This is freaking cruel!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.61,0:06:08.69,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,You're the cruel one, Yamauchi-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.69,0:06:11.58,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,How could you betray your own classmates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.58,0:06:12.68,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,D-Damn you!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.40,0:06:23.09,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You have the lowest ability in this class.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.09,0:06:25.96,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,And you betrayed your comrades.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.96,0:06:27.83,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I formed my opinion based on this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:27.83,0:06:30.02,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Wait a minute, Horikita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.93,0:06:32.73,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What is it, Hirata-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:33.12,0:06:35.83,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I made the decision to \Nlet you finish speaking,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:36.44,0:06:38.83,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,but I'm opposed to how you're doing this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:38.83,0:06:40.34,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Hirata!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.34,0:06:42.97,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Tearing down your own comrades is wrong!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.45,0:06:45.50,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,This is the only way to do this.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:45.50,0:06:48.26,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You still haven't accepted that?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.26,0:06:50.64,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I shouldn't have to accept it!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.64,0:06:52.81,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I don't want to lose anybody!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.81,0:06:54.68,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Y-Yeah! He's right!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.68,0:06:59.13,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Regardless of your feelings, I will \Nfight in the way I believe is right.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:59.83,0:07:01.16,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I want to take a vote,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.16,0:07:04.32,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,right now, on who's going to put \Nnegative votes on Yamauchi-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.32,0:07:05.65,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,You can't do that!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.65,0:07:07.40,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I'm going to begin.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.40,0:07:10.54,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Stop this right now, Horikita-san.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.54,0:07:12.66,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You have no authority to stop me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.27,0:07:15.61,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,This whole conversation is wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:15.61,0:07:17.84,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Then what do you believe we should do?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.84,0:07:18.83,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I—
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.58,0:07:20.87,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Horikita...
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.41,0:07:23.09,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Shut the hell up, would you?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.84,0:07:26.09,Main,Sato,0,0,0,,Hirata-kun?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:26.09,0:07:27.84,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Listen up, everyone.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.35,0:07:33.66,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I don't give a damn if what \Nshe said is true or not.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.66,0:07:35.83,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,It's {\i1}not{\i0} true, Hirata!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.83,0:07:37.48,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I'm a victim here!
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.73,0:07:39.17,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,A victim?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.97,0:07:44.09,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,After everything that's come out, \Nit's clear you're part of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.73,0:07:46.38,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,And it's not just him.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.71,0:07:49.72,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,You're all so comfortable \Nwith destroying a friend,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.72,0:07:50.99,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,it makes me want to vomit.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.99,0:07:52.87,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,The vote is tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:52.87,0:07:55.12,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Would you prefer to face it without a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.36,0:07:57.47,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,What's wrong with not having a plan?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.17,0:08:01.12,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,We have no right to pass \Njudgment on our classmates.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:01.33,0:08:02.93,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Just what are you getting at?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.93,0:08:05.58,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Maybe you're the one who shouldn't be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.49,0:08:11.39,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Rallying others to take someone \Ndown—it's unacceptable behavior.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.74,0:08:13.17,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,You're speaking in platitudes.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.17,0:08:17.64,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,There was already a group formed \Nto quietly destroy Ayanokoji-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.64,0:08:21.25,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Yes, and that's also abominable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.67,0:08:25.77,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,But it's not the same as \Nassuming leadership like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.01,0:08:28.71,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,It is the same. In every respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.08,0:08:31.79,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,And even if we don't take a vote right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.79,0:08:33.66,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,I've finished conveying my thought process.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.08,0:08:35.30,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,That's true.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:35.85,0:08:38.22,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,The die has been cast.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.60,0:08:40.41,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,That's why...
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.85,0:08:46.04,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,Tomorrow, I'm writing your \Nname down as a negative vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.35,0:08:48.84,Main,Hirata,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.84,0:08:50.76,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,Yes, do as you wish.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.76,0:08:54.55,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,I know you all think this \Ntest is unreasonable.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.77,0:08:56.83,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,But when you go out into the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:56.83,0:09:00.56,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,there will be times when it's \Nnecessary to cut people loose.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:05.69,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,At such times, those in power will \Nbe forced to make that judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.23,0:09:11.19,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,As long as you view this test as \Nmere cruelty, you will never mature.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.58,0:09:15.95,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,I have no intention of interfering \Nin your discussion today.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.80,0:09:21.46,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,That said, think carefully \Nbefore your vote tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.98,0:09:34.22,Main,Class D Boy A,0,0,0,,Tomorrow's the last day we'll have \Nto look at Ryuen's face, huh?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:34.69,0:09:36.38,Main,Class D Boy B,0,0,0,,I'm pretty damn sick of it.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.38,0:09:38.09,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,You look depressed.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:38.09,0:09:40.99,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,Are you that sad about \NRyuen-kun being expelled?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.41,0:09:46.18,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Do you really like picking \Nfights with me that much?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.18,0:09:47.48,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,Nah.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.48,0:09:51.65,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,Hey, Ibuki-san, I'm gonna \Ncast a negative vote for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.05,0:09:55.18,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,I guess you're gonna cast one for me?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:55.18,0:09:56.24,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,No idea.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:56.57,0:09:57.51,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,Oh, yeah?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:58.35,0:10:00.46,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,You seem awfully confident,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:00.46,0:10:03.36,Main,Manabe,0,0,0,,but if Ryuen-kun is expelled, \Nyou'll be right behind him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.07,0:10:06.75,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Ibuki, can we talk?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:07.15,0:10:08.39,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:08.39,0:10:11.39,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,It's about Ryuen-san's private points.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.39,0:10:12.39,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:12.72,0:10:14.49,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,They're where they've always been.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:14.49,0:10:16.39,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You haven't gotten them off him yet?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:16.77,0:10:19.93,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,If he gets expelled, they all disappear.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:19.93,0:10:23.27,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Then why don't you beg him to hand them over?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:23.64,0:10:25.52,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,My hands are tied.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:26.01,0:10:30.52,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Well, it does look to the \Nworld like you've deposed him.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.91,0:10:33.57,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,If they knew you'd talked to him, \Nthey'd look on you with suspicion.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:33.57,0:10:36.53,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Damn it. What the hell am I even doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.14,0:10:41.23,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Isn't it for the best for \NRyuen to just be gone?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:42.09,0:10:44.26,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You sure you're okay with this?
Dialogue: 0,0:10:44.26,0:10:47.79,Main,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,He's our only possible chance \Nof making Class A, ever.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:53.30,0:10:55.89,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I've confirmed the points transfer.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:55.89,0:10:57.49,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I'm officially done with you now.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.08,0:11:01.18,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,That was a hell of an ask, you know.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:01.56,0:11:03.38,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I'm sure it's what you wanted, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:03.38,0:11:04.90,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,If you really didn't want me to have them,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:04.90,0:11:06.69,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,you'd have gone on one last spending spree.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:10.86,0:11:12.65,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,What are you doing?!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:16.59,0:11:20.48,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,I'm rather fond of that belligerent attitude.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:23.97,0:11:26.80,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You're tough, but you \Nleave too many openings.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:27.34,0:11:29.61,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,You'll never beat Suzune like that.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:29.93,0:11:31.54,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I didn't ask you!
Dialogue: 0,0:11:31.75,0:11:32.84,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Later.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:36.42,0:11:40.09,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Did you enjoy your time at this school?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:42.93,0:11:43.99,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:55.32,0:11:57.99,Main,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I retrieved the private points from Ryuen.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:00.57,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,125)\fs12\c&H939595&\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\3c&HF0F0F0&}Nagumo Miyabi
Dialogue: 0,0:11:58.57,0:12:00.57,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fs8\bord0\fnTimes New Roman\shad0\b1\c&HD5C4BC&\pos(320,178)}Accept?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:05.25,0:12:07.12,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Don't worry, everyone!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.12,0:12:10.33,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,We won't be expelling anyone here.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:10.60,0:12:14.71,Flashback,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,But how are you going to make up the \Nfour million points we're missing?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.71,0:12:19.33,Flashback,Ichinoze,0,0,0,,President Nagumo will be filling in the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:19.33,0:12:20.97,Flashback,Kanzaki,0,0,0,,The student council president?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:21.18,0:12:25.04,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,It might be a burden on you all \Nuntil I can pay them back...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:25.04,0:12:26.85,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Is that okay?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.85,0:12:29.79,Flashback,Amikura,0,0,0,,Awesome! That's our Honami-chan!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:29.79,0:12:31.94,Flashback,Shiranami,0,0,0,,I'm totally in!
Dialogue: 0,0:12:43.22,0:12:46.13,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Honami? Is this about my proposal?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:46.75,0:12:52.11,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Yes... There's one last thing \NI wanted to confirm with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:52.11,0:12:53.37,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,What is it?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:53.37,0:12:56.68,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Well, that is... do you...
Dialogue: 0,0:12:58.53,0:13:01.51,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,D-Do you really like me?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:01.78,0:13:04.77,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,I wouldn't have asked for this if I didn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:05.89,0:13:08.74,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Give your consent, \Nand I'll send you the points.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.74,0:13:10.96,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,We'll consider that a contract signed.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:10.96,0:13:12.15,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Not quite yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:12.72,0:13:15.52,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I want to pursue other options \Nuntil the very last moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:16.19,0:13:17.74,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,Just be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:17.74,0:13:20.41,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,The time limit is midnight tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:20.41,0:13:23.70,Italics,Nagumo,0,0,0,,And I'm very concerned with punctuality.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.70,0:13:26.43,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Okay. I promise I'll call.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:33.73,0:13:36.29,Main,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I really thought I'd worked \Nup my courage, too...
Dialogue: 0,0:13:43.53,0:13:46.05,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,How is Katsuragi-kun acting?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:47.11,0:13:49.31,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,He's been pretty quiet.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:49.31,0:13:52.31,Main,Hashimoto,0,0,0,,Feels like he's accepted his expulsion.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:53.80,0:13:55.56,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,That's very good to hear.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:55.56,0:14:00.11,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,By the way... it appears the project \NI was working on with Yamauchi-kun
Dialogue: 0,0:14:00.11,0:14:02.10,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,has been exposed.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.10,0:14:04.45,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,Sounds like you messed up, Sakayanagi.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.45,0:14:08.36,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The minute I heard they were \Nhaving a class trial, I knew.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.36,0:14:10.75,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,It was just a matter of when.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:10.75,0:14:14.83,Main,Kamuro,0,0,0,,But now it's not clear who will be expelled.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.83,0:14:18.35,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,No, I see just how the game will play out.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.77,0:14:23.44,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Yes, and the king really \Nmust remain until the end.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:32.39,Sign_Basic,,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,875)\an8\c&H3D221B&\bord0\shad0\pos(320,150)}Voting Begins at 9:00
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.84,0:14:35.87,Sign_Basic,,0,0,0,,{\an8\c&H3D221B&\bord0\shad0}Follow-up Special Exam
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.16,0:14:37.85,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,We will now begin the class vote.
