Dialogue: 0,0:14:44.98,0:14:49.49,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(0,550)\an8\fnGeorgia\fs20\shad0\3c&H34332E&\bord1.5}Follow-up Special Exam\NJust Before Announcement of Results
Dialogue: 0,0:14:46.99,0:14:50.23,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,Hey. Quiet down, Haruki!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:50.23,0:14:51.24,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:52.95,0:14:56.62,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,He's a man anxiously awaiting his sentence.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:58.47,0:15:00.99,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Well, fine. I guess I can tell you now!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:00.99,0:15:03.27,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Sorry, all!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:03.27,0:15:05.38,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I'm not the one getting expelled today!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:05.38,0:15:06.63,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Oh?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.63,0:15:12.36,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi-chan promised to give \Nme Class A's positive votes!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.36,0:15:15.60,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,So it won't matter how many of you \Nput me down for negative ones!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.60,0:15:20.27,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,That's right! I'm under Class A's protection!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:23.55,0:15:26.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,How many of you guys gave me a negative vote?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.29,0:15:30.65,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I didn't even really betray you guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:30.65,0:15:32.74,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Talk about unfair treatment!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:33.51,0:15:36.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,But it's no problem. I forgive you!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.91,0:15:41.91,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Take your seat, Yamauchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.91,0:15:43.36,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,'Kay.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.32,0:15:46.25,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,I will now announce the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:48.25,0:15:51.75,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,First, the top three positive vote getters.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.58,0:15:53.69,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Third place,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.23,0:15:55.60,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Kushida Kikyo.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.52,0:15:58.00,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Second place...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:59.27,0:16:00.84,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Hirata Yosuke.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:01.45,0:16:03.54,Main,Onodera,0,0,0,,Even after what he said,\Nno one would give him a negative vote.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.54,0:16:07.05,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That ugly scene earlier \Ndidn't hurt him too badly.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:07.81,0:16:13.03,Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's a sign of how much trust \Nhe's earned over the past year.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.47,0:16:12.16,Main_Top,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I must be in first place!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:13.65,0:16:17.53,Main,Ike,0,0,0,,B-But... if Hirata's number two, \Nwho's number one?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.53,0:16:20.04,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,The number one positive vote getter...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.59,0:16:30.19,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Ayanokoji Kiyotaka... It's you.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.19,0:16:30.92,Main,Kushida,0,0,0,,No way...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.92,0:16:32.12,Main,Sudo,0,0,0,,Why him?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:32.95,0:16:35.11,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,A-Ayanokoji?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:35.11,0:16:37.68,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Don't you mean the number \None {\i1}negative{\i0} vote getter?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:37.97,0:16:39.49,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,No, I'm quite sure of this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.07,0:16:41.69,Main,Horikita,0,0,0,,What did you do?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:42.06,0:16:46.31,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,And the number one negative vote \Ngetter, I'm afraid, is you...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:46.64,0:16:48.10,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Yamauchi Haruki.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:48.10,0:16:49.03,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,How?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:49.37,0:16:51.82,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,How, how, how did this happen?!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:53.07,0:16:57.32,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,This stupid... stupid exam!
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.32,0:17:00.64,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,You're free to think what you want, \Nbut these are the results.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:00.64,0:17:02.08,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:02.29,0:17:03.72,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,That's it. Sakayanagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:03.72,0:17:05.61,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,Go talk to Sakayanagi!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:05.61,0:17:07.84,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,She said she'd give me their positive votes!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.84,0:17:10.09,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,How could she betray me like this?!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.74,0:17:12.75,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Leave, Yamauchi.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:13.35,0:17:16.09,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,No! No, no, no!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.39,0:17:18.68,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Leave the room at once.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.68,0:17:21.88,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,You've already been deleted from existence.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:21.88,0:17:23.77,Main,Yamauchi,0,0,0,,I refuse to accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.05,0:17:27.77,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,So, to the very end, you're pathetic, ugly,
Dialogue: 0,0:17:27.77,0:17:31.13,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,and unsalvageably defective?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:36.28,0:17:38.87,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Coming at me with murderous intent?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:39.22,0:17:42.02,Main,Koenji,0,0,0,,Then you have no right to complain \Nabout what you get in return.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:43.66,0:17:45.18,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,That's quite enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:45.91,0:17:49.92,Main,Chabashira,0,0,0,,Stop now, Yamauchi. For your own sake.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:16.69,0:18:18.07,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,The number one negative vote getter is...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:19.74,0:18:21.03,Main,Mashima,0,0,0,,Totsuka Yahiko.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:24.11,0:18:25.14,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,Impossible!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:25.86,0:18:29.83,Main,Katsuragi,0,0,0,,Sakayanagi! Weren't you focusing \Nnegative votes on me?!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.53,0:18:33.58,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,The answer is simple.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:33.58,0:18:36.63,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Unlike Totsuka-kun, you're actually talented.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.11,0:18:39.84,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,I wouldn't be so foolish as to remove \Na valuable piece from my board.
Dialogue: 0,0:18:40.59,0:18:42.11,Main,Yahiko,0,0,0,,Damn it!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.79,0:18:44.21,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,Now, I wonder...
Dialogue: 0,0:18:44.21,0:18:48.35,Main,Sakayanagi,0,0,0,,What are the other classes up to right now?
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.73,0:18:55.23,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\an7\fs14\pos(20,20)\c&H487DB2&\3c&H23191B&\shad0}Class Vote Results, Year 1\N{\c&HCAC6CB&}Expelled \N{\c&H986946&}Class A: {\c&HCAC6CB&}Totsuka Yahiko\N{\c&H986946&}Class B: {\c&HCAC6CB&}None\N{\c&H986946&}Class C: {\c&HCAC6CB&}Yamauchi Haruki\N{\c&H986946&}Class D: {\c&HCAC6CB&}Manabe Shiho
Dialogue: 0,0:18:57.74,0:19:00.99,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\pos(320,285)\fnArial\b1\bord0\shad0\fscy150\fsp2}Manabe Shiho
Dialogue: 0,0:18:59.45,0:19:00.99,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Ah, Manabe...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:01.19,0:19:03.19,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,She screamed her head off.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:03.19,0:19:04.12,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Did she?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:08.17,0:19:09.78,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Hey, Ayanokoji.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:10.29,0:19:12.88,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,When, exactly, did you become a good guy?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:13.29,0:19:14.41,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What do you mean?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.41,0:19:15.88,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Don't play dumb.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:16.49,0:19:19.51,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Why'd you work to save me?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:19.51,0:19:23.58,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,The ones who worked were the \Npeople who respected you.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:24.05,0:19:27.27,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fad(725,0)\fnGeorgia\fs20\shad0\3c&H34332E&\bord1.5\pos(320,280)}A Few Days Ago
Dialogue: 0,0:19:25.63,0:19:27.27,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,{\an8}Please, Ayanokoji!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:27.85,0:19:31.02,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Tell us how to keep Ryuen-san \Nfrom being expelled!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:31.24,0:19:34.02,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Ryuen's expulsion can't be prevented.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:34.02,0:19:36.52,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You're saying there's nothing you can do?
Dialogue: 0,0:19:36.83,0:19:39.33,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,He's already accepted it.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:39.33,0:19:43.43,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,It's the job of people who respect \Nhim to sympathize with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:43.43,0:19:45.65,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,But I... I...
Dialogue: 0,0:19:46.49,0:19:49.40,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,If I might offer a word of advice,
Dialogue: 0,0:19:49.40,0:19:54.54,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,it would be a waste to let Ryuen's \Nprivate points go down with him.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:54.54,0:19:55.61,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,Gimme a break!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:55.61,0:19:58.05,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,You want me to take his points \Nand kick him out the door?!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:58.05,0:20:02.42,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,This exam isn't designed to be so \Nforgiving that you can save someone
Dialogue: 0,0:20:02.42,0:20:04.89,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,just by asking for help.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:05.45,0:20:07.81,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Are you prepared to do what's necessary?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:07.81,0:20:09.01,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Prepared?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:16.51,0:20:19.32,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I retrieved the private points from Ryuen.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:20.05,0:20:21.97,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,How many did he have?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:21.97,0:20:23.52,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,A little over five million.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:23.52,0:20:24.82,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,That's enough.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:25.45,0:20:27.67,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,I'm going to bring someone else into this.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:28.65,0:20:30.71,Flashback_Italics,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,Come back to my room.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:32.50,0:20:33.46,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You mean...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.16,0:20:36.46,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,Good evening!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:37.25,0:20:38.87,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,G-Good evening...
Dialogue: 0,0:20:41.43,0:20:44.19,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I'm going to call everyone in Class B
Dialogue: 0,0:20:44.19,0:20:46.84,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,and have them submit positive \Nvotes for Ryuen-kun.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:46.84,0:20:51.35,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,In exchange, please give us \Nthe extra points we need.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:51.96,0:20:54.77,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,This way, Class B won't expel anyone,
Dialogue: 0,0:20:55.24,0:20:57.61,Flashback,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,and Ryuen can stay in Class D.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:57.61,0:20:59.77,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,A matter of mutual interest?
Dialogue: 0,0:20:59.77,0:21:01.29,Flashback,Ishizaki,0,0,0,,O-Of course!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:01.29,0:21:03.32,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You're a real idiot, though.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:03.52,0:21:04.07,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,What?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:04.38,0:21:08.57,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,You're blowing all the points \Nyou worked so hard to save up.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:08.57,0:21:12.33,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,I don't think you're in any \Nposition to criticize me there.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:13.21,0:21:17.31,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,You have five million points in your pocket,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:17.31,0:21:19.63,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,and you're using them to save Ryuen-kun!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.73,0:21:22.71,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,We're not the same.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:23.05,0:21:27.11,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,Besides, someone in my class is gonna \Nend up crying in Ryuen's place.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:28.85,0:21:30.61,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,It could even be me.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:30.97,0:21:34.58,Flashback,Ichinose,0,0,0,,But you'll still get to \Nsave Ryuen-kun, right?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:35.03,0:21:36.25,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I...
Dialogue: 0,0:21:36.61,0:21:40.27,Flashback,Ibuki,0,0,0,,I just don't like letting this \Nend with me still in his debt.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:48.45,0:21:51.88,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,So I was saved by Ishizaki and Ibuki?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:52.52,0:21:54.75,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,I'm simultaneously grateful and annoyed.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:54.75,0:21:56.31,Main,Ayanokoji,0,0,0,,What will you do next?
Dialogue: 0,0:21:56.65,0:21:58.25,Main,Ryuen,0,0,0,,Dunno.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:04.76,0:22:06.26,Sign_Basic,sign,0,0,0,,{\fnTimes New Roman\b1\c&HDEDE5D&\3c&H6D4E53&\shad0}You Have a New Message\N{\c&HE8E0DC&}Sender: Sakayanagi Arisu\NCancel  Open
